{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>想一次過完成一百下掌上壓，單靠意志並不足夠，關鍵在於課表怎樣安排。《100 Pushups Trainer》以每週三節的漸進計劃陪練，並由猩猩角色 Kito 記錄你的成長，適合想在家有系統地訓練上肢力量的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-124.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>鏡頭自動計算次數</h2>\n<p>把手機平放地面，臉部靠近鏡頭，Face ID 相機每秒量度面部距離六十次，向上推時自動計數。訓練每週三節，分容量、金字塔與重量，每第六節為極限測試，達標便加量，連續兩次未達標則減量。由獼猴到銀背猩猩共十二階段，成長靠最佳一組累積，另有語音報數與動態島休息倒數，無需帳號或訂閱。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-395-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-396-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-397-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-398-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-399-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-400-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：100 Pushups Trainer: PushApe</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/100-pushups-trainer-pushape/id6807421454?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:41:20.983884+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T12:25:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:57.737123+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:38:39.670684+00:00","content_hash":"98e3e3f1b4c6db2be84e761f279bd7ff34e1ccee70d997b71a99a9ab1ed39fdf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}